      "writtenOn": "2024-12-03T04:03:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking more closely at the use cases, I intentionally did not update configs that use \u003cpin-set\u003e. This is because, an app using pin-set tends to pin an intermediate certificate (or a root certificate), with the leaf certificate still being able to pass CT verification. So there is no reason to implicitly disable CT here.",
